{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1062828/block/singleImage/3262184/df/01M6EEJEBWP447Q707855KNPRE.jpg?updatedAt=1794215757\"/><figcaption>大帽山48歲男子行山時心口痛昏迷，直升機送院搶救不治(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日（9日）中午12時03分，警方接獲一名48歲姓楊男子報案，指自己在荃灣大帽山道近大欖林道獨自行山期間，突然感到心口痛。 救援人員接報趕至，消防處及政府飛行服務隊人員亦到場協助搜救。楊男其後被尋獲，惟他已昏迷，由直升機送往東區醫院搶救，其後惜告不治。警方將安排為楊男驗屍以確定死因，案件列作「送院時死亡」跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:42:03.750227+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":189,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T09:15:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:35:53.789567+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:35:53.789567+00:00","content_hash":"2fab17103bfba85a04e030a567ebe4b3bbbd62a23980d61491138a4f57ff60c9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}